# ============================================
# FA Report Improvement Skill - .gitignore
# ============================================

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# iCloud Drive 會產生「原名 + 空格 + 數字」的衝突副本(見 docs/handoff/
# 2026-09-05-zoe-verification-p0p2-execution.md)。gitignore **不解析引號**,
# 所以 `".coverage "*` 這種寫法會被當成字面上以 `"` 開頭的 pattern 而完全失效。
# 中間的空格不需跳脫,只有結尾空格才要。
.coverage
.coverage.*
.coverage *
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# OS
*~
*.tmp
*.bak

# 環境變數(包含 API key)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 工具產生的暫存檔
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# WSL metadata
*:Zone.Identifier

# Report files(隱私 + 由 CI 動態產生)
report/*.pptx
report/*.json
report/*.txt
!report/.gitkeep

# Build artifacts(由 CI 動態產生)
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Synthetic fixture 產物(由 CI 跑測試時動態產生,不需 commit)
tests/integration/_synthetic_fixtures/*_smoke.pptx
tests/integration/_synthetic_fixtures/*_smoke_bounds.pptx
tests/integration/_synthetic_fixtures/*_smoke_dyn.pptx
tests/integration/_synthetic_fixtures/*_vq*.pptx
tests/integration/_synthetic_fixtures/*_improved*.pptx